atabase" value=""/></div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="game-button primary" data-state="closed" href="/tools/equipment-compare">Compare equipment</a><a class="game-button" data-state="closed" href="/tools/enhancement-calculator/kr">Plan enhancement</a></div><div class="hero-factions" role="group" aria-label="Faction theme"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true">elyos</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">asmodian</button></div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="class-artwork art-hero"><img alt="" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 680px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></section><main class="home-content"><div class="shell"><div data-state="open" class="home-intro"><h2><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_35fb9tb_" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open">Aion 2 items, classes and planning tools<span class="disclosure-chevron" data-open="true" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></button></h2><div data-state="open" id="radix-_R_35fb9tb_" class="intro-content"><p>Find attributes, requirements and set bonuses in the <a href="/db/items/tw">Taiwan item database</a>. <a data-state="closed" href="/tools/equipment-compare">Compare equipment</a> side by side, or use the <a data-state="closed" href="/tools/enhancement-calculator/kr">Korea enhancement calculator</a> to plan attempts and materials. Explore <a href="/classes">classes</a>, <a href="/db/dungeons">dungeons</a> and their <a href="/db/mobs">bosses</a>.</p></div></div><section class="home-section home-guides"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Equipment and skill guides</h2><a class="game-button" href="/guides">Read guides</a></div><div class="article-card-grid"><a class="article-card" href="/guides/party-effect-overlap"><div class="article-card-image"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="730" height="521" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/guides/party-effect-overlap/higher-level-buff.webp"/></div><h3>Aion 2 party buffs: which Taiwan skill effects do not stack?</h3><p>Check the documented Cleric, Chanter, Gladiator and Templar effect overlaps in Aion 2 Taiwan before doubling up on a party buff or debuff.</p><span class="article-card-date"><time dateTime="2026-09-23">September 23, 2026</time></span></a><a class="article-card" href="/guides/skill-planning"><div class="article-card-image"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="1400" height="745" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/guides/skill-planning/mastery-window.webp"/></div><h3>Aion 2 skill planning: mastery, stigma and party effects</h3><p>Plan Aion 2 Taiwan skills by separating mastery upgrades, stigma choices and party-effect overlaps. Check activation conditions before spending resources.</p><span class="article-card-date"><time dateTime="2026-09-23">September 23, 2026</time></span></a><a class="article-card" href="/guides/enhancement-costs"><div class="article-card-image"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="678" height="276" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/guides/enhancement-costs/next-attempt.webp"/></div><h3>Aion 2 enhancement costs - planning Kinah and materials in Korea</h3><p>Plan Aion 2 Korea enhancement costs with failure bonuses, average and maximum Kinah, material budgets and the difference between attempt odds and spending limits.</p><span class="article-card-date"><time dateTime="2026-09-21">September 21, 2026</time></span></a><a class="article-card" href="/guides/equipment-comparison"><div class="article-card-image"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="962" height="498" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/guides/equipment-comparison/attack-difference.webp"/></div><h3>Aion 2 equipment comparison - Noble or Splendent Greatsword?</h3><p>Compare Noble, Splendent and Guardian greatswords in Aion 2 Taiwan. Check Attack, random rolls, requirements and set bonuses before changing equipment.</p><span class="article-card-date"><time dateTime="2026-09-21">September 21, 2026</time></span></a></div></section><section class="home-section home-news"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Aion 2 news</h2><a class="game-button" href="/news">Read news</a></div><div class="article-card-grid"><a class="article-card" href="/news/global-release-faq"><div class="article-card-image"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="800" height="450" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/news/global-release-faq/announcement.webp"/></div><h3>Aion 2 global FAQ confirms PC plans, languages and server regions</h3><p>NCSOFT lists the global version&#x27;s supported languages and server regions. PC is the announced platform; full controller support remains undecided.</p><span class="article-card-date"><time dateTime="2026-09-23">September 23, 2026</time></span></a><a class="article-card" href="/news/launch-preparation"><div class="article-card-image"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="800" height="450" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/news/launch-preparation/announcement.webp"/></div><h3>Aion 2 Steam players need a separate launch download</h3><p>Steam Playtest participants need the full Aion 2 installation for Advanced Access. Check the September 30 start, October 5 launch and progress reset.</p><span class="article-card-date"><time dateTime="2026-09-23">September 23, 2026</time></span></a></div></section><section class="home-section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Choose your class</h2><a class="game-button" href="/classes">Compare roles</a></div><div class="roster"><a class="class-card" data-role="tank" href="/db/class/templar"><div class="class-artwork art-card"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 45vw, (max-width: 1000px) 30vw, 280px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fclasses%2Ftemplar.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="class-card-copy"><span class="class-role">Tank</span><h3>Templar</h3></div></a><a class="class-card" data-role="melee-dps" href="/db/class/gladiator"><div class="class-artwork art-card"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 45vw, (max-width: 1000px) 30vw, 280px